A surface becoming visible must not auto-focus an editable on touch: focusing
pops the on-screen keyboard over the content the user came to see (upstream
gated only iOS for some of these, #122044 / #127832 family; the settings and
keybindings editors got the same treatment in settings-mobile.diff). A tap on
the field still focuses it.

